            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Tokyo Sachi Vân Đồn",
            "review_text": "Tran T\nNha Trang, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nGreat Japanese dinner\nNov 2024 • Friends\nI recently dined at Tokyo Sachi Restaurant and loved the authentic Japanese atmosphere here. The menu offered a wide variety of Japanese dishes, from fresh sashimi and sushi to hearty ramen and grilled options. The sushi was fresh and beautifully presented, and ramen is delicious. They even offer complimentary dessert at the end of the meal. The staff were attentive and knowledgeable, making the experience even better. Highly recommended for anyone seeking genuine Japanese cuisine!\nRead more\nWritten November 13, 2024",
